On UNIX (don't know about Windows), you can edit your ".nethackrc" file like 
this:

   OPTIONS=race:hum
   OPTIONS=role:rog
   OPTIONS=gender:fem
   OPTIONS=name:Klepto

To get a human female rogue named Klepto.  You can then put other groups of 
options lines in the file, and "comment out" all but one group by putting a 
"#" in front of each line.  You can then switch between different saved games 
by putting a comment in front of your current name, and uncommenting another 
name line.

Of course, this isn't what you asked for, but it works for me...

